# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-2 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-octo2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# OD1 (LEVER 1, B1): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-draft = the control plus QWEN_FAST_OCTO_DRAFT=1, the tests of OC1. An octo round with all eight seats live is drafted by ONE eight-seat, eight-row pass (octo_draft_tp, docs/tp4-octo-draft.md).
# READ: c2_smoke_check clean with the draft rule (octo_judge.draft_problems: admitted once, engaged once at conv=110, at least 16 draft rounds and half the octo rounds at 8 live, no fallback, no disabled marker);
# then, offline, the TEXT read: python3 scripts/ci/octo_compare.py --control <OC1 smoke log> --octo <OD1 smoke log> --octo-container <OD1 container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-draft (every answer's content hash, reasoning hash,
# token count and finish reason equal, user by user: ANY difference is NO-GO) and the PAIRED read: python3 scripts/ci/octo2_report.py --control <OC1 container log> --arm <OD1 container log> (GO at +5 percent on the octo rate
# per seat, aggregate AND median, the m3 rounds of both boots within 5 percent of each other; it prints the early-draft ms and the tokens per seat-round, the tau change, beside it). The drafts are T8: a tau loss larger than
# the time gain is the finding. Duration (estimate): 60 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-draft
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
